      "rating": 3,
      "text": {
        "text": "A small coffee shop in east jakarta, at cipinang jaya. They have smoking area and non smoking area...also outdoor seats.\nI ordered hot coffee latte and also half portion off cheese bread.\nBut they both rather average (from my opinion).\nBut the good thing is the price are affordable..",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
